#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:83
msgid "Project matrix"
msgstr "项目矩阵"

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:86
msgid ""
"sbt 2.x introduces project matrix, which enables cross building to happen in "
"parallel by representing cross build using subprojects."
msgstr ""
"sbt 2.x 引入了项目矩阵，通过以子项目表示交叉构建，使交叉构建可以并行进行。"

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:88
msgid ""
"````admonish example title=\"build.sbt\"\n"
"```scala\n"
"lazy val scala3 = \"3.8.3\"\n"
"lazy val scala2_13 = \"2.13.18\"\n"
"\n"
"organization := \"com.example\"\n"
"scalaVersion := scala3\n"
"version      := \"0.1.0-SNAPSHOT\"\n"
"\n"
"lazy val core = (projectMatrix in file(\"core\"))\n"
"  .settings(\n"
"    name := \"core\",\n"
"  )\n"
"  .jvmPlatform(scalaVersions = Seq(scala3, scala2_13))\n"
"  .nativePlatform(scalaVersions = Seq(scala3, scala2_13))\n"
"  // .jsPlatform(scalaVersions = Seq(scala3))\n"
"\n"
"// optional\n"
"lazy val core3 = core.jvm(scala3)\n"
"lazy val coreNative3 = core.native(scala3)\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/cross-building-setup.md:111
msgid ""
"````admonish example title=\"project/plugins.sbt\"\n"
"```scala\n"
"addSbtPlugin(\"org.scala-native\" % \"sbt-scala-native\" % \"0.5.11\")\n"
"```\n"
"````"
msgstr ""

